&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist engineers in a wide range of fluid system design tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare technical documentation such as Piping &amp;amp; Instrumentation Diagrams and hardware specification lists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and expand a catalog of parts used across our fluid system facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create templates, documents, or calculation tools to support our internal engineering workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
