&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and commitment to data accuracy and compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-oriented mindset with a passion for operational excellence and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with HR systems and digital HR processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently while collaborating effectively across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English and German&lt;/li&gt;
