 needs</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Drive collaboration: Work closely with other teams to align APIs, technical interfaces, and architectural consistency</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own and operate the domain and the team’s microservices. </p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you offer us:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Proven people leadership skills, with an empowering style that enables rather than micromanages</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong and up-to-date hands-on experience working with Kotlin/Spring Boot, Mongo/PostgresDB</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A “You build it, you run it” mindset, with experience in deploying, monitoring, and maintaining microservices on Kubernetes.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong understanding of how to create and evolve REST-APIs that clients like to use and Event-driven processing pipelines built on Kafka.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions, and to align diverse stakeholders</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Strong engineering fundamentals in building secure, scalable, and reliable systems, including security-by-design, resilience patterns, and operating production systems at scale.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience with agentic AI development practices and operating models.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What we offer:</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">State-of-the-art technologies and an agile environment (Check our Tech Radar: <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="https://lotto24.github.io/tech-radar/">https://lotto24.github.io/tech-radar/</a>)</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A modern, dynamic culture grounded in the success of a leading-edge e-commerce company.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A talented