ik (m/w/d)","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em">At Knuspr, speed matters. Quality matters. But none of it works without people who know what they’re doing from day one. That’s where our trainers come in.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re looking for a Warehouse Trainer who will help new colleagues settle in fast, learn the job properly, and grow into confident, high-performing team members. This role is part onboarding, part coaching, part culture-building — and a big part of what makes our warehouse teams work well together. If you enjoy working with people, teaching by example, and helping others improve every day, this is your opportunity to shape our operational performance directly on the floor.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Why this role is exciting</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Direct impact:</strong> You’ll have a direct influence on how quickly new employees become productive, confident, and successful in their daily work.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>On-the-ground leadership:</strong> You’ll help shape team culture right on the warehouse floor — not from behind a desk.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Key operational partnership:</strong> You’ll work closely with team managers as a trusted partner for onboarding, development, and floor performance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Diverse daily work:</strong> You’ll support both newcomers and existing team members across various departments, making every day different.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Real ownership:</strong> People will rely on you directly for guidance, clarity, and practical support.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>What you’ll do</strong></p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Onboarding &amp; Training:</strong> Coordinate and lead onboarding for new warehouse employees across different departments and ope