&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; You are comfortable with Terraform and CI/CD patterns across AWS and GCP, and enjoy working alongside DevOps and security colleagues to harden them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentoring &amp;amp; Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; You help other engineers grow through design reviews, code reviews and pairing. You work across squads, take part in architecture reviews and share standards that other teams choose to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; You work well with Analytics Engineers, Data Scientists, Machine Learning Engineers, legal and security, and can explain technical trade-offs clearly to non-technical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
