&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Share Engineering Practices:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the wider Data Platform team to agree on and uphold good engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embed Governance &amp;amp; Security:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with legal and security colleagues on governance, data compliance and security policies, including HIPAA/PHI handling, UK GDPR and cross-border access to patient data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver Infrastructure as Code:&lt;/strong&gt; Help shape how we approach DevOps on Terraform (IaC) and CI/CD within the data platform, taking responsibility for versioning and deployment of data pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Engineering Depth:&lt;/strong&gt; You are an experienced data engineer (typically 5+ years) who can design and look after pipelines end to end, from ingestion through to consumption. You are comfortable working with Python, SQL, dbt, Kafka, Flink, Airflow and REST APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
