&lt;p&gt;WPP Media is WPP&#39;s AI-driven media operating unit, bringing together media, data, and partnerships to deliver creative personalisation at scale. Connected through WPP Open and powered by Open Intelligence, clients see exactly where, how, and why their media investment is working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, visit &lt;a href=&quot;wppmedia.com&quot;&gt;wppmedia.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4079 - Senior Associate, MM&amp;amp;D Operations, UK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary and Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Operations Specialist to join our energetic and growing Operations Team at EssenceMediaCom. The Operations team are fully responsible for digital display &amp;amp; social campaign activation. Each member of our team can be thought of as a Project Manager liaising with many different internal teams and external media owners to ensure a campaign launches on time and delivers as per the client requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting of the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Operations Manager.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Three best things about the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Ownership &amp;amp; autonomy of the digital activation from booking to billing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;The team! Our core team and the broader departments we collaborate with boast huge diversity and a wealth of cumulative experience, providing opportunities for everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; developing – every day, every campaign and every project is different which will help unleash your potential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measures of success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 3 months, you would have: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Got to grips with the whole booking to billing process for digital campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidently created client campaign reports and understand the data validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Successfully managed the booking to reconciliation cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 6 months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently booked digital display campaigns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Been troubleshooting technical issues that may arise in campaign activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forged strong working relationships with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisted manager with workload balancing and training for junior team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In 12 months, you would have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively come up with ideas/solutions to make improvements to the client’s account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked and contributed to team projects to make agency workflow more efficient.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning operational business tasks including accurately booking media plans onto systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinating the execution of strategic client campaigns from booking to launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with Tech counterpart to ensure all plans are implemented efficiently and on time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with both the internal local market and global teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting on client reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning monthly financial reconciliation of digital campaign activity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively managing financial queries to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively with the rest of the team to proactively find solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building positive working relationships with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within an Operations or Account / Campaign Management function (ideally with knowledge of trafficking processes, including pixels and tags) is preferential, but not essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use of Excel and capability to analyse complex data sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and relationship building skills, with the ability to train others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process-driven with solutions focused mind-set and a customer-centric attitude.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good at problem solving, with the ability to resolve issues in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team player who motivates others and encourages close collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to train others and encourage knowledge sharing across team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong accountability to meet deadlines and a perfect attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage workload in a highly pressured environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at organisation, multi-tasking, time management, and project management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to utilise a confident communication style to manage stakeholder expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Media&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our passion for shaping the next era of media is powered by our commitment to&amp;nbsp;Be Extraordinary, investing in our employees to inspire transformational creativity. We also&amp;nbsp;Lead Optimistically,&amp;nbsp;firmly believing&amp;nbsp;in and&amp;nbsp;Championing Growth and Development&amp;nbsp;for every individual. This commitment allows WPP Media employees to&amp;nbsp;leverage&amp;nbsp;the extensive global WPP Media &amp;amp; WPP networks to pursue their passions, build vital professional connections, and learn at the&amp;nbsp;cutting edge&amp;nbsp;of marketing and advertising.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
