ered by a deep software + hardware stack: lab instruments worth millions of USD reverse-engineered into API-controllable hardware, dozens of devices orchestrated through complex workflows, full observability on everything that happens in the lab, processing pipelines for messy physical-world data, and AI systems that troubleshoot production results and accelerate assay development.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re growing rapidly and are hiring for talented people to scale and support the massive demand for AI-driven wet lab experimentation.</p><h2>About the Role</h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As AI designs more of biology, the bottleneck moves to experiments: running them fast, at scale and with data people can trust. Adaptyv is the company best positioned to become the verification layer for biology, and long-term partnerships with pharma, biotech and frontier AI labs are how we get there.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You find the partners where Adaptyv can become core infrastructure. You shape the terms, and you run the deal: scientific scope, pricing, legal, and the internal plan to deliver it. You also design new partnership models and the deals that do not fit a standard quote.</p><h2>What You'll Do</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Lead the largest deals.</strong> Source, structure and close strategic partnerships with pharma, biotech and frontier AI labs.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Set the terms.</strong> Pricing, data rights, exclusivity, milestones. You find structures where both sides win.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Align the company behind each deal.</strong> The lab, the scientists and engineering deliver what you sign, so you bring them in early.</p></li></ul><h2>What We're Looking For</h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Deal-maker with a track record.</strong> You have closed complex, high-value deals in life sciences, AI or dee