&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
