&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Video call with your future manager to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Business case presentation with 2 - 3 team members (ideally in house) to assess your practical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Final interview with the VP Sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Team Fit interview.&lt;/li&gt;
