er and for some a dedicated CSM.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">When you're not delivering customer trainings, you help the wider team stay useful year-round: you build standardized video trainings based on the most common questions coming out of our support center, and you're available to represent Rentman at customer events or trade shows in German-speaking markets.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h1><strong>What you'll do</strong></h1><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Integrate Rentman knowledge with customer-centricity and commercial acumen to provide tailored training, in both German and English, that enhances customer usage, satisfaction, and professional services revenue.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Deliver at least 60% of your time as direct, standardized-but-tailored training to customers, one-on-one or in groups.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">When you're not training customers, build standardized video trainings/webinars addressing the most common issues raised through our support center.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Represent Rentman at customer-facing events or trade shows in German-speaking markets when needed.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Always look for opportunities to expand and optimize our professional services and serve more customers in a standardized way.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Maintain top-level knowledge of Rentman's functionality and industry challenges to advise customers effectively, and keep this knowledge current.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Excel in administration and process efficiency to ensure internal processes (availability, booking, invoicing) run smoothly, and the customer journey is frictionless.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Adopt a customer-friendly attitude and deliver high-quality training to ensure an optimal customer experience.</p></li></ul><div style="text-align:left"><img style="max-width:100%" src="https://