e-prosus-way"><em>culture and values</em></a><em>.</em></p><p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>","remote":false,"url":"https://www.arbeitnow.nl/jobs/companies/prosus/director-of-finance-ecosystem-amsterdam-85525","tags":["Investment Org. - Finance"],"job_types":["Full Time"],"location":"Amsterdam","created_at":1794595221},{"slug":"senior-cyber-security-specialist-amsterdam-453476","company_name":"Prosus","title":"Senior Cyber Security Specialist","description":"<p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>Who We Are</strong></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You've ordered dinner through Just Eat Takeaway. You've bought and sold on OLX. You've paid with PayU. Chances are, you've already used a Prosus company today.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We are Prosus, a global technology company powering some of the world's leading lifestyle ecommerce businesses. Every day, billions of people across India, Latin America, Europe and beyond use our products and services to buy, sell, pay, connect and discover.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Our AI-driven ecosystem spans 100+ companies across ecommerce, food delivery, fintech and experiences, serving billions of consumers worldwide. AI powers how we operate and innovate, with more than 60,000 active AI agents helping our teams build, scale and move faster. Through our investment team, we also back the founders and technologies shaping the future: From robotics and autonomous systems to synthetic biology and frontier AI.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Guided by our five values <strong>Innovation, Results, People, Impact, and Entrepreneurship,</strong> culture is our competitive advantage. We thrive with experimentation; we build, we test, we learn, we iterate.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">Join us in shaping the future of technology at global scale.</p><h2><strong>The Problem You'll Solve</strong></h2><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Senior Cyber Specialist, you'll be part of Prosus' Global Cyber team, helping our businesses identify, understand and manage their most critical cyber and technology risks.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You'll work across a diverse portfolio of businesses, delivering hands-on security testing, advisory and assurance projects that strengthen security.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">You will use AI natively in everything you do. Your work will span a broad range of cybersecurity and technology domains, including:</p><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Delivering cyber risk assessments, security reviews and controls testing across complex technology environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Conducting red teaming exercises and long-term Advanced Persistent Threat (APT) simulations to identify vulnerabilities and test organisational resilience.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Assessing cloud infrastructure, data platforms, DevOps environments and CI/CD pipelines to identify security weaknesses and opportunities for improvement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Designing and facilitating cyber crisis simulations to test business preparedness and incident response capabilities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Providing practical, constructive recommendations that help management strengthen security without slowing down innovation or business growth.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partnering with technology and business leaders across our global portfolio to translate complex technical risks into meaningful business outcomes.</p></li></ul><p style="min-height:1.5em">This is a full-time global role based in our Amsterdam (Zuidas) office, with up to 30% international travel.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h2><strong>Who You Are</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A hands-on cybersecurity professional with strong technical specialist experience in offensive security, security engineering or red teaming. You enjoy getting into the technical detail, investigating threats and identifying weaknesses rather than focusing solely on governance, risk and compliance.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">An AI and technology enthusiast who enjoys understanding how systems work, building harnesses and getting hands-on with complex technical environments.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Comfortable navigating code, CI/CD pipelines, cloud environments and modern technology architectures.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Entrepreneurial in your mindset, with exposure to both fast-moving start-ups and larger, more mature IT organisations, not afraid to use AI to get the job done.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A confident communicator who can build trusted relationships, tell compelling stories and translate technical concepts into clear business language.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Equally comfortable engaging with CTOs, CIOs, security leaders, architects, developers and system administrators.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">A global mindset, with interests beyond technology and an openness to travelling internationally, including to less conventional destinations.</p></li></ul><h2><strong>What You Bring</strong></h2><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">3–7 years of relevant professional experience in cybersecurity, with a strong technical foundation in offensive security, threat intelligence, red teaming or related disciplines.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Practical experience conducting or supporting penetration tests, security assessments, adversary simulations, threat investigations or other offensive security activities.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Hands on work with AI harnesses and offensive AI models.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Experience working with cloud technologies, data platforms and modern software engineering environments.</p></li><