w" href="http://app.n8n.cloud/register"><u>app.n8n.cloud/register</u></a>.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><p style="min-height:1.5em">We’re in a defining moment of an incredible journey. Come and build with us.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">🎯 Your main goal will be to land and expand n8n inside the world’s largest organisations, closing the biggest deals in our portfolio.</p><p style="min-height:1.5em">As a Large Enterprise Account Executive covering Nordics &amp; Benelux, you will own a territory of global-scale accounts and lead long, complex deals from first conversation to multi-year commitment:</p><p style="min-height:1.5em"></p><h3>BUILD STRATEGIC ACCOUNT PLANS</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Build and execute account strategies for organisations with 5,001 or more employees</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Open doors with outbound campaigns aimed at CTOs, CIOs and engineering and platform leaders.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Turn community adoption inside large companies into sponsored, funded opportunities.</p></li></ul><h3>LEAD COMPLEX, MULTI-THREADED DEALS</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Run deep discovery, quantify business impact and build an executive-level business case.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Map and align decision makers across engineering, IT, security, legal and procurement.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Partner with Solutions Engineers, Partnerships and Customer Success to prove value and de-risk adoption.</p></li></ul><h3>CLOSE AND EXPAND AT SCALE</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Own the cycle through security, legal and procurement, typically over three to six months or more.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Negotiate six-figure deals with confidence and keep clear commercial control.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em">Plan expansion across business units and use cases, and share what you learn with Product and leadership.</p></li></ul><h2>REQUIREMENTS</h2><h3>Must-haves</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🏢 Large Enterprise sales:</strong> You have at least five years of enterprise SaaS sales experience, selling into organisations with 5,001 or more employees, and you can explain customer size, deal complexity and cycle length.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>💰 Six-figure deals:</strong> You have closed multiple deals of £100k+ ACV in multi-stakeholder cycles of three to six months or more.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧑‍💻 Technical buyers and executives:</strong> You have sold to developers, engineers, CTOs and CIOs, and you can carry a technical conversation and an executive one in the same deal.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🎯 New-logo hunter:</strong> You generate your own pipeline through outbound and win new customers rather than relying on expansion or inbound.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📈 Track record:</strong> You have consistently hit or exceeded quota over the past two to three years.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🧭 Structured selling:</strong> You use a methodology such as MEDDPICC and navigate technical evaluations, procurement, legal and security reviews.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>📍 Location:</strong> You are based in the Nordics / Benelux. This role involves regular travel to customers in the region.</p></li></ul><h3>Nice-to-haves</h3><ul style="min-height:1.5em"><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🛠️ Technical product background:</strong> You have sold developer tools, cloud infrastructure, data, AI or automation platforms.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🤝 Partner-led deals:</strong> You have worked deals with system integrators or cloud partners.</p></li><li><p style="min-height:1.5em"><strong>🚀 Open source or PLG exposure:</strong> You understand how community 